<title>USA: BTM/Schroders to release store sales on Wed May 28.</title>
<headline>BTM/Schroders to release store sales on Wed May 28.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTM/Schroders said it will release its next report on weekly chain store sales on Wednesday, May 28 due to the Memorial Day holiday on Monday.</p>
<p>BTM/Schroders usually releases its reports on Tuesdays.</p>
<p>The data, which will be for the week ended May 24, typically are embargoed until 0900 EDT/1300 GMT.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
</text>
